# Review: ebd088491c1395e815774038
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/0a0c6de639acf77ee44f814f5570402054b7424e/Monero-GUI/monero-core_sv.ts
# Evidence-SHA256: 8b885ba25a017c3c710f3ec4f089b8cb75b3e922819fcbbd1f0cb7cf5f3e4429
